  <name>Falcon PDF</name>
  <summary>Professional PDF viewer and editor</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Falcon PDF is a fast, cross-platform PDF viewer and editor. View, annotate,
      and edit PDFs, read eBooks (EPUB, FB2, MOBI), and run document tools such as
      merge, split, compress, and convert.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Fast PDF rendering and navigation</li>
      <li>Annotate, edit, and sign documents</li>
      <li>eBook reading (EPUB, FB2, MOBI, AZW)</li>
      <li>PDF tools: merge, split, compress, convert, rotate, reorder</li>
      <li>Open Office documents (DOC, DOCX, ODT, RTF) and images</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">com.falconpdf.app.desktop</launchable>

